      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Roll back the turn when stopping picture work**\n\nWhen the user stops after the text proposal has returned but while pictures are still being prepared, this commits the prompt/reply to `history` and clears `submitted` before the cancellable phase finishes. `cancel()` then restores the previous draft but neither removes that history entry nor restores the prompt, so the transcript describes a discarded update and retrying requires retyping or sends duplicate context. Defer committing the turn until picture preparation completes, or explicitly roll back the history and prompt on cancellation.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
