      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Block browser navigation while a draft save is pending**\n\nWhen a parent presses the browser Back button during `onApply`, this handler immediately clears the draft route and unmounts `AiConversation`, bypassing its `saving.current` guard. If the asynchronous storage write then fails, the error is no longer shown in the conversation and the unsaved draft cannot be retried, so browser history navigation needs to honor the same save-in-progress protection as the page Back button.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
