      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Update the storage file headers for picture persistence**\n\nAdding the exported PNG store, resolver, and pruning functions makes the file-level header inaccurate because it still says this module keeps only photo and speech files; the equivalent header in `storage.web.ts` likewise omits its new picture store. Update both platform headers so they describe the picture-asset responsibility introduced here.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L3-L6](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/252b863380ee1c76b80a901aafbee6dd92135946/AGENTS.md#L3-L6)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
